424659.overview:
Fantasya Final Definitiva REMAKE is the compilation of a series of games originally made in RPG Maker 2000 almost a decade ago, now completely remade in RPG Maker 2003.

These games tell the story of Samuka, a drunk who wanders around aimlessly and with no goal in life (except to get even drunker).

His sense of morality and justice, however, lead him to a lot of trouble that results in an epic adventure that defies even the limits of time and space.

Relive the classics that, along with other legends of the genre, marked a generation of Brazilian fans of RPG Maker games.

Contains:

- Classic narrative and gameplay of old RPGs;
- The remake of both original games in a single compilation;
- The charismatic characters and unexpected twists that marked a generation;
- All the Secret Extras from the original versions;
- The innovative and never-before-seen MaComBa System;
- Completely adapted to the Action Battle System of RM2k3;
 - Extended dungeons, new items, new equipment and more!

468422.overview:
Unchain humanity from a rogue AI using all your skills before it's too late. Set in a dystopian future, Full Void is a 2D Cinematic Puzzle Platformer telling the story of a young teenager alone in a hostile world controlled by a rogue AI. Fight your way through puzzles and obstacles to uncover the story that surrounds this broken, run down society, where only children are still free. But for how long? A pure hand-drawn pixel art adventure that will keep you on your toes from the very beginning, with a few jump scares and a thrilling atmosphere.

Full Void is a spiritual successor to classic cinematic puzzle platformers of the 80s and 90s, with a modern twist, innovative visual and gameplay mechanics. Along with traditional puzzles, you can use your hacking skills to interact with elements of the game and make your way through this hostile world full of creatures continuously on the verge to get you. In a 2D world, aspects of 3D have been integrated both in the gameplay and visuals.

The game features hand-drawn pixel art graphics and custom animations that are integral part of the gameplay, along with dynamic lighting, minimalistic sound design and immersive cutscenes for an atmosphere that will keep you on your toes from the very beginning.

Full Void tells a story of oppression and isolation through the environment and gameplay with the support of compelling ambient sounds and old-school Amiga MOD music. Visually, each screen has been composed and drawn with care and passion, designed to inspire awe and a sense of uncertainty. With no side scrolling in the game, moving from one screen to another can sometimes require a leap of faith.

Features
• Environmental Storytelling;- Original, hand-drawn pixel art;
• Interactive cut-scenes all hand drawn and animated
• Ability to hack machinery to solve puzzles;
• Immersive and intense atmosphere;
• Minimalistic sound design
• Compelling, Amiga MOD sounds;
• Dynamic lighting
• Not too "retro-style" check points :)
